        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Capricorn — 1st (Signature) Technique, gained at level 1.</em></p><p>Your arm is the sword. You have simply stopped pretending otherwise.</p><p>Until the end of your turn, your unarmed Strikes deal slashing damage, gain the deadly d10 trait, and ignore Hardness.</p><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> At 10th level the deadly die becomes d12. At 14th and 18th level, your Strikes deal an additional 1d6 slashing damage.</p><p><em>On a day your constellation is Ascendant this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a Zenith, 8 levels higher.</em></p>"
